  "ref": "dxvk",
  "kind": "vulkan",
  "note": "The requirement list is not typed by hand: it is the ENABLE_FEATURE/ENABLE_EXT/ENABLE_EXT_FEATURE table in getFeatureList(), which DXVK walks to reject a device. `true` = hard requirement (device creation fails), `false` = optional (behaviour only). A game that DXVK refuses needs the whole hard column green, not one row.",
