  "d3d_levels": {
    "source": "src/dxvk/dxvk_device_info.cpp",
    "comment": "DXVK does not expose a D3D feature level: a game asks for FL 11_0 and DXVK either has the features or refuses. The FL a game gets therefore comes from the wined3d-GL chain (consumers/wined3d-gl.json) or from DXVK's own feature set. This map names the DXVK features each D3D capability group is built on; kept small and source-backed via annotations.json d3d_level."
